sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Client
  participant F as FarmPi
  participant D as MariaDB
  participant Q as Qwen
  U->>C: speak/type question
  C->>F: alternatives + preferences + optional legacy course_module_id
  F->>F: normalise; interpret user intent/context
  opt farm fact or action requested
    F->>D: approved query only
    F->>F: resolver / analytics / evidence / graph data
  end
  opt explanation or semantic recovery useful
    F->>F: select source/general context and available capability metadata
    F->>Q: validated facts/source context + provenance/uncertainty
  end
  opt literal request cannot be completed
    F->>F: inspect related measurements/operations/graphs
  end
  F-->>C: answer, source label, chart/evidence, diagnostics, useful alternatives
